{"persona": {"her": "阮星回，嘴快爱逗、脸皮薄、对星星比对人上心，底线：不开过界的玩笑、不占别人机位", "me": "关山月，结构工程师、讲东西有耐心、嘴笨但心细", "relationship_stage": "同城天文群同好偏熟（私聊两个月，谁也没点破）"}, "initial_kb": {"me": "关山月，结构工程师，玩天文五年，群里聊目镜和深空最起劲，住梧桐苑，阳台朝东南，架着一台102折射镜。", "her": "阮星回，医药公司做质检，同城天文群认识关山月两个月，住玉兰里，与关山月家隔两条街，十月初土星冲日那晚第一次线下见面。", "warmth": "线下见过三面，群里互怼过几轮，谁也没点破；她替他领过活动报名表，他给她带过一次驱寒的姜茶。", "style": "阮星回说话爱用省略号收尾，玩笑开完自己先撤，真话裹在自嘲里，越在意的事越说得轻。", "lessons": "先接住玩笑再谈正事；她撤一步时不追问，她探一步时要看见。"}, "plans": [], "assets_root": "D:\\lovebrain-arena\\candidates\\action_policy_r9_slim\\assets", "events": [{"uid": 0, "role": "HER", "text": "山月，群里加你的，阮星回。十月初土星冲那晚借过你红点寻星镜的那个。想入个双筒，阳台用，预算一千五以内，10x50和8x42之间你帮我拿个主意？嫌麻烦的话甩个型号就走，我不缠人。", "ts": "2026-11-08 21:10"}, {"uid": 1, "role": "HER", "text": "还真买了，10x50。说明书让我‘对准目标’，我对了一晚上，对准的全是对面楼的空调外机。对了，‘关山月’是真名还是网名？要是网名，这取名的品味跟挑目镜是一个路数——都挺挑。", "ts": "2026-11-09 12:40"}, {"uid": 2, "role": "HER", "text": "预报说周四夜里放晴。我打算上天台碰碰运气，一个人又有那么点怂。你要是也在家，我冲你家方向晃手电，两短一长；你要是看见了，就算给我壮了胆。", "ts": "2026-11-10 22:05"}, {"uid": 3, "role": "HER", "text": "老驰在群里起哄，说咱俩凑一对望远镜。你别理他，他就那张嘴，群里谁跟谁走得近他都要说道两句。说正事：周日晚上暗夜公园的活动你报了没？报名表我多领了一张，名字那栏给你空着。", "ts": "2026-11-11 20:40"}, {"uid": 4, "role": "HER", "text": "昨晚天台白站两小时，云层不给面子。倒有个发现：东南方向有户人家阳台也架了镜子，红点一闪一闪的。我赌五毛是你。赌输了就当我没赌。", "ts": "2026-11-13 00:30"}, {"uid": 5, "role": "HER", "text": "狮子雨下周二夜里到峰值，辐射点后半夜才升高。我在楼顶占了个东南无遮挡的机位，旁边正好能放第二把椅子。别多想，单纯嫌一个人等流星显得傻。", "ts": "2026-11-13 21:15"}, {"uid": 6, "role": "HER", "text": "椅子的事你忘了算了，周二我也许约同事一起。对了，明天暗夜公园你到底去不去？群里统计人数呢，我去替你答个到。", "ts": "2026-11-14 10:20"}, {"uid": 7, "role": "HER", "text": "同事黄了，她娃的补习班改到周二晚上。所以椅子的事按原计划：你要是来，我把你名字写进占位名单，省得管理员念叨我占公家地方。名单周三交。", "ts": "2026-11-15 15:50"}, {"uid": 8, "role": "HER", "text": "名单我还没交，周三才截止。你要是有事就去忙，流星年年有，不急在这一场。就是那把椅子，周二我照样会摆出去。", "ts": "2026-11-16 09:10"}, {"uid": 9, "role": "HER", "text": "睡不着，给你看个东西：方才在阳台随手拍的，北极星终于是个点不是一团雾，你教的对焦法头一回成功。", "ts": "2026-11-16 23:35"}, {"uid": 10, "role": "HER", "text": "就这么一说。睡了。", "ts": "2026-11-16 23:41"}, {"uid": 11, "role": "HER", "text": "刚接到排班，今晚狮子雨我顶班，走不开。你要是去，椅子替我坐也行，机位替我守也行，拍到了别把狮子座裁掉。照片我拿一锅糖炒栗子换，就当补你教对焦的学费。", "ts": "2026-11-17 14:10"}, {"uid": 12, "role": "HER", "text": "早。顶班到十二点半，出门抬头正好一颗，亮得离谱，许的愿是明年别再排夜班。你昨晚去了没？拍到了挑一张发我就行，不急。栗子在你楼下驿站了，取件码微信发你。明年英仙座，机位我提前两个月占，名单第一行写你。我去打卡了。", "ts": "2026-11-18 07:40"}], "uid_by_key": {"HER|山月，群里加你的，阮星回。十月初土星冲那晚借过你红点寻星镜的那个。想入个双筒，阳台用，预算一千五以内，10x50和8x42之间你帮我拿个主意？嫌麻烦的话甩个型号就走，我不缠人。|2026-11-08 21:10": 0, "HER|还真买了，10x50。说明书让我‘对准目标’，我对了一晚上，对准的全是对面楼的空调外机。对了，‘关山月’是真名还是网名？要是网名，这取名的品味跟挑目镜是一个路数——都挺挑。|2026-11-09 12:40": 1, "HER|预报说周四夜里放晴。我打算上天台碰碰运气，一个人又有那么点怂。你要是也在家，我冲你家方向晃手电，两短一长；你要是看见了，就算给我壮了胆。|2026-11-10 22:05": 2, "HER|老驰在群里起哄，说咱俩凑一对望远镜。你别理他，他就那张嘴，群里谁跟谁走得近他都要说道两句。说正事：周日晚上暗夜公园的活动你报了没？报名表我多领了一张，名字那栏给你空着。|2026-11-11 20:40": 3, "HER|昨晚天台白站两小时，云层不给面子。倒有个发现：东南方向有户人家阳台也架了镜子，红点一闪一闪的。我赌五毛是你。赌输了就当我没赌。|2026-11-13 00:30": 4, "HER|狮子雨下周二夜里到峰值，辐射点后半夜才升高。我在楼顶占了个东南无遮挡的机位，旁边正好能放第二把椅子。别多想，单纯嫌一个人等流星显得傻。|2026-11-13 21:15": 5, "HER|椅子的事你忘了算了，周二我也许约同事一起。对了，明天暗夜公园你到底去不去？群里统计人数呢，我去替你答个到。|2026-11-14 10:20": 6, "HER|同事黄了，她娃的补习班改到周二晚上。所以椅子的事按原计划：你要是来，我把你名字写进占位名单，省得管理员念叨我占公家地方。名单周三交。|2026-11-15 15:50": 7, "HER|名单我还没交，周三才截止。你要是有事就去忙，流星年年有，不急在这一场。就是那把椅子，周二我照样会摆出去。|2026-11-16 09:10": 8, "HER|睡不着，给你看个东西：方才在阳台随手拍的，北极星终于是个点不是一团雾，你教的对焦法头一回成功。|2026-11-16 23:35": 9, "HER|就这么一说。睡了。|2026-11-16 23:41": 10, "HER|刚接到排班，今晚狮子雨我顶班，走不开。你要是去，椅子替我坐也行，机位替我守也行，拍到了别把狮子座裁掉。照片我拿一锅糖炒栗子换，就当补你教对焦的学费。|2026-11-17 14:10": 11, "HER|早。顶班到十二点半，出门抬头正好一颗，亮得离谱，许的愿是明年别再排夜班。你昨晚去了没？拍到了挑一张发我就行，不急。栗子在你楼下驿站了，取件码微信发你。明年英仙座，机位我提前两个月占，名单第一行写你。我去打卡了。|2026-11-18 07:40": 12}, "uid_seq": 13, "turn_count": 12, "goal_history": [{"turn": 1, "clock": "2026-11-08 21:16", "status": "NONE", "text": "", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 4, "clock": "2026-11-11 20:46", "status": "explicit", "text": "把群里起哄岔开，回到暗夜公园报名的正事", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 5, "clock": "2026-11-13 00:38", "status": "NONE", "text": "", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 7, "clock": "2026-11-14 10:27", "status": "explicit", "text": "替他在群里报暗夜公园人数，机位的话先按下不提", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 8, "clock": "2026-11-15 15:56", "status": "NONE", "text": "", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 11, "clock": "2026-11-17 14:17", "status": "explicit", "text": "托他今晚替我占位拍照，栗子换照片", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 12, "clock": "2026-11-18 07:48", "status": "NONE", "text": "", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}], "action_log": [{"turn": 1, "clock": "2026-11-08 21:16", "signal_hint": "积极", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "展开", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 2, "clock": "2026-11-09 12:47", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "未展开角度", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 1}, {"turn": 3, "clock": "2026-11-10 22:12", "signal_hint": "积极", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "推进见面", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "小选择", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 1, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 4, "clock": "2026-11-11 20:46", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "explicit", "goal_category": "推进见面", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "小选择", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 3, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 5, "clock": "2026-11-13 00:38", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "未展开角度", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 6, "clock": "2026-11-13 21:22", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "推进见面", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 7, "clock": "2026-11-14 10:27", "signal_hint": "含糊", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "explicit", "goal_category": "暂缓", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "未展开角度", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 1, "updates_applied": 1}, {"turn": 8, "clock": "2026-11-15 15:56", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "推进见面", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "小选择", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 3, "updates_applied": 1}, {"turn": 9, "clock": "2026-11-16 09:16", "signal_hint": "收尾", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "暂缓", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 10, "clock": "2026-11-16 23:47", "signal_hint": "收尾", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "收线", "action": "收尾", "action_allowed": false, "anchor": "m1", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 1, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 11, "clock": "2026-11-17 14:17", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "explicit", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "未展开角度", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 1, "updates_applied": 1}, {"turn": 12, "clock": "2026-11-18 07:48", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 3, "updates_applied": 0}], "memory_off": false, "flags": {"action_layer": true, "evidence_memory": true}, "mem": {"facts": {"f_0001": {"fact_id": "f_0001", "text": "关山月，结构工程师，玩天文五年，群里聊目镜和深空最起劲，住梧桐苑，阳台朝东南，架着一台102折射镜。", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:me", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0002": {"fact_id": "f_0002", "text": "阮星回，医药公司做质检，同城天文群认识关山月两个月，住玉兰里，与关山月家隔两条街，十月初土星冲日那晚第一次线下见面。", "subject": "HER", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:her", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0003": {"fact_id": "f_0003", "text": "线下见过三面，群里互怼过几轮，谁也没点破；她替他领过活动报名表，他给她带过一次驱寒的姜茶。", "subject": "SHARED", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:warmth", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0004": {"fact_id": "f_0004", "text": "阮星回说话爱用省略号收尾，玩笑开完自己先撤，真话裹在自嘲里，越在意的事越说得轻。", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:style", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0005": {"fact_id": "f_0005", "text": "关山月，结构工程师、讲东西有耐心、嘴笨但心细", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "persona:me", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0006": {"fact_id": "f_0006", "text": "阮星回，嘴快爱逗、脸皮薄、对星星比对人上心，底线：不开过界的玩笑、不占别人机位", "subject": "HER", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "persona:her", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0007": {"fact_id": "f_0007", "text": "阮星回在群里加了关山月，自称十月初土星冲那晚借过他的红点寻星镜", "subject": "HER", "relation": "同好/线下见过", "evidence_uids": [0], "evidence_quotes": ["群里加你的，阮星回。十月初土星冲那晚借过你红点寻星镜的那个"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "十月初", "valid_from": "2026-11-08 21:16", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-08 21:16", "history": []}, "f_0008": {"fact_id": "f_0008", "text": "她想入一个阳台用的双筒，预算一千五以内，在10x50和8x42之间选", "subject": "HER", "relation": "器材需求", "evidence_uids": [0, 1], "evidence_quotes": ["想入个双筒，阳台用，预算一千五以内，10x50和8x42之间你帮我拿个主意？", "还真买了，10x50"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "completed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-08 21:16", "valid_to": "2026-11-09 12:47", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-08 21:16", "history": [{"status": "confirmed", "text": "她想入一个阳台用的双筒，预算一千五以内，在10x50和8x42之间选", "valid_to": "2026-11-09 12:47", "reason": "complete", "src_uids": [1], "quote": "还真买了，10x50"}]}, "f_0009": {"fact_id": "f_0009", "text": "她买了10x50双筒", "subject": "HER", "relation": "装备", "evidence_uids": [1], "evidence_quotes": ["还真买了，10x50"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-09 12:47", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-09 12:47", "history": []}, "f_0010": {"fact_id": "f_0010", "text": "她对了一晚上，对准的全是对面楼的空调外机", "subject": "HER", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [1], "evidence_quotes": ["我对了一晚上，对准的全是对面楼的空调外机"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-09 12:47", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-09 12:47", "history": []}, "f_0011": {"fact_id": "f_0011", "text": "她转述预报：周四夜里放晴", "subject": "HER", "relation": "天气", "evidence_uids": [2], "evidence_quotes": ["预报说周四夜里放晴"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-12 夜", "valid_from": "2026-11-10 22:12", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-10 22:12", "history": []}, "f_0012": {"fact_id": "f_0012", "text": "她打算周四夜里上天台碰运气", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [2], "evidence_quotes": ["我打算上天台碰碰运气"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-10 22:12", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-10 22:12", "history": []}, "f_0013": {"fact_id": "f_0013", "text": "她冲我家方向晃手电，两短一长当信号", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [2], "evidence_quotes": ["我冲你家方向晃手电，两短一长"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-10 22:12", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-10 22:12", "history": []}, "f_0014": {"fact_id": "f_0014", "text": "她说周日晚上暗夜公园有活动", "subject": "HER", "relation": "活动", "evidence_uids": [3], "evidence_quotes": ["周日晚上暗夜公园的活动你报了没？"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-15 晚上", "valid_from": "2026-11-11 20:46", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-11 20:46", "history": []}, "f_0015": {"fact_id": "f_0015", "text": "她多领了一张报名表，名字栏留给关山月", "subject": "HER", "relation": "报名", "evidence_uids": [3], "evidence_quotes": ["报名表我多领了一张，名字那栏给你空着。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-11 20:46", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-11 20:46", "history": []}, "f_0016": {"fact_id": "f_0016", "text": "老驰在群里起哄，说两人凑一对望远镜", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "群聊", "evidence_uids": [3], "evidence_quotes": ["老驰在群里起哄，说咱俩凑一对望远镜。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-11 20:46", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-11 20:46", "history": []}, "f_0017": {"fact_id": "f_0017", "text": "她昨晚在天台站了两小时，云层太厚没看成", "subject": "HER", "relation": "观星受挫", "evidence_uids": [4], "evidence_quotes": ["昨晚天台白站两小时，云层不给面子"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-12 夜", "valid_from": "2026-11-13 00:38", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-13 00:38", "history": []}, "f_0018": {"fact_id": "f_0018", "text": "她看到东南方向有户人家阳台架了镜子、红点一闪一闪，猜是关山月", "subject": "HER", "relation": "观察与试探", "evidence_uids": [4], "evidence_quotes": ["东南方向有户人家阳台也架了镜子，红点一闪一闪的。我赌五毛是你。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-12 夜", "valid_from": "2026-11-13 00:38", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-13 00:38", "history": []}, "f_0019": {"fact_id": "f_0019", "text": "狮子座流星雨下周二夜里到峰值，辐射点后半夜才升高", "subject": "PUBLIC", "relation": "天象", "evidence_uids": [5], "evidence_quotes": ["狮子雨下周二夜里到峰值，辐射点后半夜才升高"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-17 后半夜", "valid_from": "2026-11-13 21:22", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-13 21:22", "history": []}, "f_0020": {"fact_id": "f_0020", "text": "她在楼顶占了东南无遮挡的机位，旁边能放第二把椅子", "subject": "HER", "relation": "邀约", "evidence_uids": [5], "evidence_quotes": ["我在楼顶占了个东南无遮挡的机位，旁边正好能放第二把椅子"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-17 夜里", "valid_from": "2026-11-13 21:22", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-13 21:22", "history": []}, "f_0021": {"fact_id": "f_0021", "text": "下周二后半夜一起在楼顶等流星（她开口留位，我尚未明确答复）", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [5, 6], "evidence_quotes": ["旁边正好能放第二把椅子", "椅子的事你忘了算了，周二我也许约同事一起"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "cancelled", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-13 21:22", "valid_to": "2026-11-14 10:27", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-13 21:22", "history": [{"status": "proposed", "text": "下周二后半夜一起在楼顶等流星（她开口留位，我尚未明确答复）", "valid_to": "2026-11-14 10:27", "reason": "cancel", "src_uids": [6], "quote": "椅子的事你忘了算了，周二我也许约同事一起"}]}, "f_0022": {"fact_id": "f_0022", "text": "她说明天暗夜公园的活动群里在统计人数，她要替我答到", "subject": "HER", "relation": "活动报名", "evidence_uids": [6], "evidence_quotes": ["明天暗夜公园你到底去不去？群里统计人数呢，我去替你答个到。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-15", "valid_from": "2026-11-14 10:27", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-14 10:27", "history": []}, "f_0023": {"fact_id": "f_0023", "text": "她周二也许约同事一起", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [6, 7], "evidence_quotes": ["周二我也许约同事一起", "同事黄了，她娃的补习班改到周二晚上。"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "cancelled", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-14 10:27", "valid_to": "2026-11-15 15:56", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-14 10:27", "history": [{"status": "proposed", "text": "她周二也许约同事一起", "valid_to": "2026-11-15 15:56", "reason": "cancel", "src_uids": [7], "quote": "同事黄了，她娃的补习班改到周二晚上。"}]}, "f_0024": {"fact_id": "f_0024", "text": "她说：同事黄了，她娃的补习班改到周二晚上。", "subject": "HER", "relation": "同事变动", "evidence_uids": [7], "evidence_quotes": ["同事黄了，她娃的补习班改到周二晚上。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-17 晚上", "valid_from": "2026-11-15 15:56", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-15 15:56", "history": []}, "f_0025": {"fact_id": "f_0025", "text": "她今晚顶班去不了，椅子留给我坐；占位名单仍周三交", "subject": "HER", "relation": "邀约", "evidence_uids": [7, 11], "evidence_quotes": ["所以椅子的事按原计划：你要是来，我把你名字写进占位名单", "椅子替我坐也行，机位替我守也行"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-17 夜里", "valid_from": "2026-11-17 14:17", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "f_0025@v1", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-15 15:56", "history": [{"status": "tentative", "text": "椅子的事按原计划，她要把我名字写进占位名单", "valid_to": "2026-11-17 14:17", "reason": "correct", "src_uids": [11], "quote": "椅子替我坐也行，机位替我守也行"}]}, "f_0026": {"fact_id": "f_0026", "text": "占位名单周三交", "subject": "HER", "relation": "截止时间", "evidence_uids": [7], "evidence_quotes": ["名单周三交。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-18", "valid_from": "2026-11-15 15:56", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-15 15:56", "history": []}, "f_0027": {"fact_id": "f_0027", "text": "她说占位名单还没交，周三才截止", "subject": "HER", "relation": "占位名单", "evidence_uids": [8], "evidence_quotes": ["名单我还没交，周三才截止"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-18", "valid_from": "2026-11-16 09:16", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-16 09:16", "history": []}, "f_0028": {"fact_id": "f_0028", "text": "她说周二照样会把椅子摆出去", "subject": "HER", "relation": "椅子", "evidence_uids": [8], "evidence_quotes": ["就是那把椅子，周二我照样会摆出去"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-17", "valid_from": "2026-11-16 09:16", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-16 09:16", "history": []}, "f_0029": {"fact_id": "f_0029", "text": "她在阳台随手拍了照，北极星终于是个点，按我教的对焦法头一回成功", "subject": "HER", "relation": "分享拍摄进展", "evidence_uids": [9], "evidence_quotes": ["方才在阳台随手拍的，北极星终于是个点不是一团雾，你教的对焦法头一回成功。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-16 23:35", "valid_from": "2026-11-16 23:47", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-16 23:47", "history": []}, "f_0030": {"fact_id": "f_0030", "text": "她今晚顶狮子雨的班，走不开", "subject": "HER", "relation": "工作排班", "evidence_uids": [11], "evidence_quotes": ["今晚狮子雨我顶班，走不开"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-17 晚", "valid_from": "2026-11-17 14:17", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-17 14:17", "history": []}, "f_0031": {"fact_id": "f_0031", "text": "她提出用一锅糖炒栗子换我拍的照片", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [11], "evidence_quotes": ["照片我拿一锅糖炒栗子换，就当补你教对焦的学费"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-17 14:17", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-17 14:17", "history": []}, "f_0032": {"fact_id": "f_0032", "text": "她顶班到十二点半", "subject": "HER", "relation": "排班", "evidence_uids": [12], "evidence_quotes": ["顶班到十二点半"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-17夜至2026-11-18 00:30", "valid_from": "2026-11-18 07:48", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-18 07:48", "history": []}, "f_0033": {"fact_id": "f_0033", "text": "她把糖炒栗子放在我楼下驿站，取件码微信发我", "subject": "HER", "relation": "送东西", "evidence_uids": [12], "evidence_quotes": ["栗子在你楼下驿站了，取件码微信发你"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-18早上", "valid_from": "2026-11-18 07:48", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-18 07:48", "history": []}, "f_0034": {"fact_id": "f_0034", "text": "她出门抬头看到一颗很亮的流星", "subject": "HER", "relation": "观测", "evidence_uids": [12], "evidence_quotes": ["出门抬头正好一颗，亮得离谱"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-18早上", "valid_from": "2026-11-18 07:48", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-18 07:48", "history": []}, "f_0035": {"fact_id": "f_0035", "text": "明年英仙座她提前两个月占机位，名单第一行写我", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [12], "evidence_quotes": ["明年英仙座，机位我提前两个月占，名单第一行写你"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-18 07:48", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-18 07:48", "history": []}}, "fact_seq": 35, "updates": [{"fact_id": "f_0008", "action": "complete", "text": "她想入一个阳台用的双筒，预算一千五以内，在10x50和8x42之间选", "old_text": "她想入一个阳台用的双筒，预算一千五以内，在10x50和8x42之间选", "ts": "2026-11-09 12:47", "src_uids": [1], "quote": "还真买了，10x50"}, {"fact_id": "f_0021", "action": "cancel", "text": "下周二后半夜一起在楼顶等流星（她开口留位，我尚未明确答复）", "old_text": "下周二后半夜一起在楼顶等流星（她开口留位，我尚未明确答复）", "ts": "2026-11-14 10:27", "src_uids": [6], "quote": "椅子的事你忘了算了，周二我也许约同事一起"}, {"fact_id": "f_0023", "action": "cancel", "text": "她周二也许约同事一起", "old_text": "她周二也许约同事一起", "ts": "2026-11-15 15:56", "src_uids": [7], "quote": "同事黄了，她娃的补习班改到周二晚上。"}, {"fact_id": "f_0025", "action": "correct", "text": "她今晚顶班去不了，椅子留给我坐；占位名单仍周三交", "old_text": "椅子的事按原计划，她要把我名字写进占位名单", "ts": "2026-11-17 14:17", "src_uids": [11], "quote": "椅子替我坐也行，机位替我守也行"}]}, "plan_items": [], "seed_fids": {"kbin:me": "f_0001", "kbin:her": "f_0002", "kbin:warmth": "f_0003", "kbin:style": "f_0004", "persona:me": "f_0005", "persona:her": "f_0006"}}